      "name": "World Labs"
    },
    "date": "2025-09-16",
    "text": "Generate persistent 3D worlds from a single image, bigger and better than ever! \n\nWe’re excited to share our latest results and invite you to try out our world generation model in a limited beta preview. https://t.co/HkPO4E5X2g\n\nWe’ve improved our model’s ability to generate clean, coherent geometry representing full 3D environments, and to imagine worlds in a variety of diverse styles.\n\nhttps://t.co/wSGhAneP2k\n\nYou can explore thousands of generated worlds in our beta preview at https://t.co/V267VJu1H9, and sign up for access to create more of your own!\n\nJoin the waitlist for model access directly at https://t.co/EnfJoSPtIO",
    "thread": [
      {
        "id": "1967986124963692715",
        "text": "Generate persistent 3D worlds from a single image, bigger and better than ever! \n\nWe’re excited to share our latest results and invite you to try out our world generation model in a limited beta preview. https://t.co/HkPO4E5X2g"
